## 📐 Data Model

The dashboard uses a structured analytical data model designed to connect transactional sales information with business dimensions.

```text
                 ┌──────────────┐
                 │    Orders    │
                 └──────┬───────┘
                        │
          ┌─────────────┼─────────────┐
          ↓             ↓             ↓
   ┌────────────┐ ┌────────────┐ ┌──────────────┐
   │  Products  │ │  Regions   │ │ Salespeople  │
   └────────────┘ └────────────┘ └──────────────┘
                        │
                        ↓
                ┌───────────────┐
                │ Sales Channel │
                └───────────────┘
```

The model supports dynamic calculations and filtering across the dashboard.

