## 🧮 DAX Measures

DAX was used to create analytical measures for the dashboard, including:

- Total Revenue
- Total Orders
- Quantity Sold
- Revenue Growth %
- Average Order Value

These measures allow KPI cards and visualizations to respond dynamically to user selections.

